<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gap Inc downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gap Inc downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gerard Klauer Mattison said analyst Thomas Filandro downgraded Gap Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report said &quot;we believe March was the second consecutive month of below trend results for the company's primary Gap division.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Lowered earnings per share estimate for fiscal year ending January 1998 to $1.88 from $1.92.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 33-5/8 in early trading.</p>
</text>
